    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>When an endless snowstorm traps a parent and child in a remote cabin, they discover its horrific history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757060/extras/3af9737ea8ee182733cde9b87f64165a.avif?t=1741303599\" /></div><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wintertwined will be a narrative focussed, puzzle horror game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>You take control of Winter, a shy but snarky young adult, who\u2019s trying to get back \u201chome\u201d safely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With the aid of Giles, Winter's parental guardian, the two of them must work together to survive the snowy apocalypse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757060/extras/4f7e48074dd2436c6a64bb361769612b.avif?t=1741303599\" /></div><strong> </strong><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wintertwined is currently in development and planned for a commercial release in 2025</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A slow burn mystery with multiple endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Original soundtrack by Harumi Makoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Puzzles with 3 difficulty levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Original spritework</p>",
